#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libarchive.xml:91
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of libarchive"
msgstr "Instalação do libarchive"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libarchive.xml:94
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>libarchive</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>libarchive</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libarchive.xml:98
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr --disable-static &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr --disable-static &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libarchive.xml:102
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue: <command>make check</command>."
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>make check</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libarchive.xml:106
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libarchive.xml:109
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libarchive.xml:112
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Still as the &root; user, create a symlink so we can use "
"<command>bsdunzip</command> as <command>unzip</command>, instead of relying "
"on the unmaintained Unzip package:"
msgstr ""
"Ainda como o(a) usuário(a) &root;, crie um link simbólico de forma que nós "
"consigamos usar <command>bsdunzip</command> como <command>unzip</command>, "
"em vez de depender do pacote Unzip não mantido:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libarchive.xml:117
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ln -sfv bsdunzip /usr/bin/unzip</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ln -sfv bsdunzip /usr/bin/unzip</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libarchive.xml:121
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"As discussed in <xref linkend='locale-wrong-filename-encoding'/>, if the Zip"
" archive to be extracted contains any file with a name containing any non-"
"Latin characters, you need to manually specify the encoding of those "
"characters or they will be turned into unreadable sequences in the extracted"
" file name.  For example, if a Zip archive created with WinZip, "
"<filename>archive.zip</filename>, contains a file named with Simplified "
"Chinese characters, the encoding should be CP936 and the <parameter>-I "
"cp936</parameter> option should be used.  I.e. the command to extract the "
"archive should be <command>unzip -I cp936 archive.zip</command>."
msgstr ""
"Conforme discutido em <xref linkend='locale-wrong-filename-encoding'/>, se o"
" arquivamento Zip a ser extraído contiver qualquer arquivo com um nome "
"contendo caracteres não latinos, você precisará especificar manualmente a "
"codificação desses caracteres ou eles serão transformados em sequências "
"ilegíveis no nome do arquivo extraído. Por exemplo, se um arquivamento Zip "
"criado com o WinZip, <filename>archive.zip</filename>, contiver um arquivo "
"nomeado com caracteres chineses simplificados, a codificação deverá ser "
"CP936 e a opção <parameter>-I cp936</parameter> deverá ser usada. Ou seja, o"
" comando para se extrair o arquivamento deverá ser <command>unzip -I cp936 "
"archive.zip</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libarchive.xml:137
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libarchive.xml:143
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--without-xml2</option>: This switch uses expat for xar archive "
"format support instead of libxml2 (which is preferred) if both packages are "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"<option>--without-xml2</option>: Essa chave usa expat para suporte ao "
"formato de arquivamento xar em vez do libxml2 (que é preferido) se ambos os "
"pacotes estiverem instalados."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libarchive.xml:149
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-nettle</option>: This switch uses Nettle for crypto support "
"instead of OpenSSL."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-nettle</option>: Essa chave usa Nettle para suporte a "
"criptografia em vez do OpenSSL."

